{"question": "Who must approve removing the system or components off-site for maintenance?", "framework_version": "rev4", "answer_text": "The removal of the information system or system components from organizational facilities for off-site maintenance or repairs must be explicitly approved by the organization-defined personnel or role.", "answer_text_with_citations": "The removal of the information system or system components from organizational facilities for off-site maintenance or repairs must be explicitly approved by the organization-defined personnel or role.

Citations: ma-2_smt.c, ma-2_smt (NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 4)", "evidence_spans": [{"source_id": "ma-2_smt.c", "span_text": "Requires that {{ insert: param, ma-2_prm_1 }} explicitly approve the removal of the information system or system components from organizational facilities for off-site maintenance or repairs;"}, {"source_id": "ma-2_smt", "span_text": "The organization: a. Schedules, performs, documents, and reviews records of maintenance and repairs on information system components in accordance with manufacturer or vendor specifications and/or organizational requirements; b. Approves and monitors all maintenance activities, whether performed on site or remotely and whether the equipment is serviced on site or removed to another location; c. Requires that {{ insert: param, ma-2_prm_1 }} explicitly approve the removal of the information system or system components from organizational facilities for off-site maintenance or repairs; d. Sanitizes equipment to remove all information from associated media prior to removal from organizational facilities for off-site maintenance or repairs; e. Checks all potentially impacted security controls to verify that the controls are still functioning properly following maintenance or repair actions; and f. Includes {{ insert: param, ma-2_prm_2 }} in organizational maintenance records."}], "status": "PARAMS_REQUIRED", "odp_required_list": ["ma-2_prm_1"], "ask_list": [{"param_id": "ma-2_prm_1", "friendly_label": "Requires that explicitly approve the removal of the", "raw_marker": "{{ insert: param, ma-2_prm_1 }}", "ask_prompt": "What value does your organization use for: Requires that explicitly approve the removal of the?", "data_type": "free-text", "cardinality": "single", "source_ids": ["ma-2_smt.c", "ma-2_smt"]}], "primary_citation": "ma-2_smt.c", "all_citations": "ma-2_smt.c, ma-2_smt", "contract_mode": "generative_rag_baseline", "debug": {"query_plan": {"original_query": "Who must approve removing the system or components off-si